    {
      "id": "1047601",
      "title": "",
      "description": "To exit a Boston College, Cleveland Circle or Riverside-bound train, exit the train at Kenmore and proceed to the eastbound platform, then take an eastbound train to Copley and use Copley Elevator 976. To exit a Heath Street-bound train, exit the train at Prudential and proceed to the eastbound platform, then take an eastbound train to Copley and use Copley Elevator 976. To board, cross Boylston St and use Copley Elevator 976 to access the eastbound platform.  Take a eastbound train to Arlington, then proceed to the westbound platform and transfer to a westbound train.",
